# tally 2.2.1, 236.3 (OPERATIONS §2.1: a scenario file that doesn't load "refuses that scenario and those
# over it, with its message"): s1 refused LOAD-WORLD (an ask naming no world), s3 over s1 refused with
# it, its own asks printing nothing; s2 answers (m3/gate-probes/sw with q_bad added). Before W8: s3
# answered, q_d3 REFCORE-NOT-YET.
=== reality.tally
model mini
  tally 2
  on 2026-11-05
  start 2026-10-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "Oświadczenia gospodarstwa"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind jobs
kind wages: event certain
  leg cash: PLN

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input bank: observed
input pay_dom[j in jobs]: int
input salary[j in jobs, m in months]: money PLN question "Ile wynosi pensja z tej pracy w tym miesiącu?"

move wage[m in months, j in jobs over m]: wages
  on day_of(m, pay_dom[j])
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount salary[j, m]

version home
  cite s
  governs 2026-10..
  known 2026-10-01
  jobs + [acme] lives 2020-02-01..
  pay_dom = 10 "umowa, § 5"
  salary = 7 000.00 PLN "umowa, § 4"
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-10-01 start "wyciąg"
=== s1.tally
scenario s1 over mini
  tally 2
  from 2026-12-01

ask q_sib: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in s2
ask q_model: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in mini
ask q_deep: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in s3
ask q_dmm: diff(bal(konto, 2026-12-31)) in mini against mini
ask q_dsib: diff(bal(konto, 2026-12-31)) in s2 against mini
ask q_dsib2: diff(bal(konto, 2026-12-31)) in s2 against s1
ask q_ddeep: diff(bal(konto, 2026-12-31)) in s3 against s1
ask q_own: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in s1
ask q_bad: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)
=== s2.tally
scenario s2 over mini
  tally 2
  from 2026-12-01

ask q_own2: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in s2
=== s3.tally
scenario s3 over s1
  tally 2
  from 2026-12-01

ask q_low: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in s1
ask q_lowm: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) in mini
ask q_dlow: diff(bal(konto, 2026-12-31)) in s1 against mini
ask q_d3: diff(bal(konto, 2026-12-31)) in s3 against s2
=== expect
scenario s1: refused: LOAD-WORLD ask q_bad in a scenario file names no world (s1.tally:13)
scenario s3: refused: LOAD-WORLD ask q_bad in a scenario file names no world (s1.tally:13)
q_own2: 22 000.00 PLN
  world: s2
  unfulfilled: wage[2026-10, acme]
  held: pay_dom[acme] = 10 (home), read for 2026-12-01
  held: salary[acme, 2026-12] = 7 000.00 PLN (home), read for 2026-12
  cut 2026-11-05
